@startuml
' issue #2622: "skinparam padding X" enlarges the cells of a Creole table
' (here rendered inside a note). Pins the current (working) behaviour so
' a regression can be caught if this stops applying.
skinparam padding 20
(*) --> "test"
note left
|= H1 |= H2 |
| a | b |
end note
@enduml
